## KingCRAB cosmogenic muons: drift and EL fields disabled (S1 only).

/control/execute macros/KingCRAB_CosmogenicMuon.common.mac

/Geometry/KingCRAB/drift_field_on false
/Geometry/KingCRAB/el_field_on false
/Geometry/KingCRAB/EL_field_intensity 0 kV/m

# Match the field-on seed so paired runs begin from the same random stream.
/nexus/random_seed 41
/nexus/persistency/output_file KingCRAB_CosmogenicMuon_FieldOff
